{"duration": 43.223, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "Mary brandished a kitchen fork like a sword, refusing anyone entry.", "start": 0.05, "end": 3.421}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Neighbors laughed, calling her a stubborn cook who feared losing work.", "start": 3.621, "end": 6.522}, {"beat": 1, "text": "They dismissed the doctor's warnings as mere gossip.", "start": 6.602, "end": 8.842}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Police dragged her to Willard Parker Hospital.", "start": 9.042, "end": 11.197}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Scientists tested her stool three times each week.", "start": 11.277, "end": 13.453}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The bacteria hid in her gallbladder, impossible to cure.", "start": 13.533, "end": 16.178}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it\u2019s like a broken spoon.", "start": 16.378, "end": 17.999}, {"beat": 3, "text": "It keeps poisoning every bowl of soup.", "start": 18.079, "end": 19.786}, {"beat": 4, "text": "She kept cooking, spreading typhoid to dozens and causing three deaths.", "start": 19.986, "end": 23.151}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The city locked her on North Brother Island to stop more outbreaks.", "start": 23.231, "end": 26.121}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Other carriers were released, given jobs, and paid rent.", "start": 26.321, "end": 29.03}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Mary alone stayed thirty\u2011six years.", "start": 29.11, "end": 30.773}, {"beat": 5, "text": "She became a scapegoat because she was a woman cook.", "start": 30.853, "end": 32.986}, {"beat": 6, "text": "When she tried to work again in 1914, another outbreak erupted.", "start": 33.186, "end": 36.51}, {"beat": 6, "text": "Investigators matched her handwriting and sent her back to the island.", "start": 36.59, "end": 39.662}, {"beat": 6, "text": "She spent the rest of her life baking cakes for fellow patients.", "start": 39.742, "end": 42.323}], "words": [{"w": "Mary", "start": 0.144, "end": 0.369, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "brandished", "start": 0.419, "end": 0.694, "line": 0, "b